Minivac 601 manuals (docs/research/raw/pdf/)
  Scientific Development Corporation. Books I-VI were published in 1961 with
  a copyright notice, and Book VII in 1962 with a copyright notice. The errata
  sheet is dated 1961/62. The maintenance manual is dated 1961 in
  docs/research; no copyright notice appears in its text extract. Book I was
  registered on 19 Aug 1961 as A526420 (Catalog of Copyright Entries, 3rd
  series, vol. 15, p. 1698). A search of the US Copyright Office online
  catalog and of NYPL's cce-renewals transcription (1978-2001) on 2026-10-15
  found no renewal of any of them, so the 1961 books lapsed into the US
  public domain at the end of 1989 and Book VII at the end of 1990. Their
  status outside the US may differ. See docs/research/history-and-artifacts.md.
  Scans by Adolfo García Yagüe / ccapitalia.net ("EX LIBRIS ccapitalia.net"),
  mirrored on archive.org item 1961Minivac601Book234; Book VII from archive.org
  item book-vii_202512. The .txt files are text extracts of those scans.
  This project is not affiliated with Scientific Development Corporation or
  ccapitalia.net.

